    {
      "id": "SC01",
      "finding": "Random social events are not conversation jobs. TryInteractWith validates, adds memories and XP, considers social fighting, invokes worker, creates interaction bubble and PlayLogEntry, and updates both last-interaction trackers. The selected three workers override selection weight only; base Interacted only initializes output fields.",
