    {
      "id": "SC03",
      "finding": "Current social mode derives from job/duty/draft/mental state; Off clears intent, Quiet clears it each interval. After >320ticks, hash60 tests MTB22000/6600/550 for Quiet/Normal/SuperActive. Failed intent retries on hash91. Generic initiator cooldown120, no symmetric receiver cooldown here. Candidates are spawned same-faction pawns, shuffled, with weighted InteractionDefs and global Rand.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": ".local-research/social-interaction/RimWorld.Pawn_InteractionsTracker.cs",
          "sha256": "1e0c942b28ca00151b617a3a30360e06378cbc3a858e86966b9b4e8f3db059d6",
