    {
      "id": "SC04",
      "finding": "Chitchat weight1, DeepTalk .075 times compatibility curve, Insult .007 times negative factor. Kind initiator nullifies negative interactions; Abrasive multiplies2.3. Negative factor uses directional opinion and fixed-pair compatibility, not mood. Slave-to-nonslave insults are suppressed. Weights compete with all other applicable InteractionDefs, so are not unconditional probabilities.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": ".local-research/social-interaction/RimWorld.InteractionWorker_Chitchat.cs",
