      "id": "SC05",
      "finding": "Interaction thoughts use the OTHER pawn SocialImpact at creation: moodPowerFactor and social opinionOffset are scaled before TryGainMemory. Chitchat/DeepTalk affect both participants; Insulted affects recipient. Social XP4/10 belongs to initiator. Actual directional amounts may differ.",
