    {
      "id": "SC07",
      "finding": "Chitchat is cumulative: new .66*otherImpact merges into same-def same-other offset without resetting age. Internal amount can exceed10; only opinion contribution is capped10. Every accumulated60000ticks it moves1 toward zero and resets age; offset==0 discards. It overrides ordinary duration and age fading.",
