    {
      "id": "SC08",
      "finding": "DeepTalk+15 and Insulted-15 have20day duration,300 total and10 per other, stacking.9. Ordinary social memories never merge, fade only after default70% duration, and discard after age>duration (or missing other/zero offset). Memory interval adds150ticks; stored offsets and age are persisted.",
