      "id": "SC09",
      "finding": "Opinion groups exclude zero contributors, sort memory age ascending (newest first), sum faded offsets times stacking powers, round each group with nonzero minimum +/-1, then sum groups. Overflow removes oldest per-other then oldest same-def. OpinionOf adds relation and situation offsets, hediff factor, hostile positive clamp and final[-100,100].",
