      "id": "SC10",
      "finding": "Insulted creates a separate InsultedMood via fresh TryGainMemory(def,other); it does not inherit SocialImpact moodPowerFactor. Mood-5 lasts2days,stack10,.9. Ordinary memory groups with different otherPawn when formatted labels match, as fixed insulted label does; full-group merge renews oldest age rather than creating an11th.",
