      "id": "SC11",
      "finding": "Compatibility is not opinion: age difference0..20 maps .45..-.45 plus stable pair-seeded asymmetric Gaussian(.3,1,1.4); seed=(idA XOR idB)*37. PushState/PopState preserves outer RNG. Directional opinion remains independently computed.",
