    {
      "id": "SC12",
      "finding": "GatherSpot newly constructed active=true; save active default=false; nonplayer fresh spawns deactivate. Changes register/unregister in activeSpots; toggle is ordinary UI and despawn unregisters. TableGatherSpotBase adds CompGatherSpot to dining tables.",
