      "id": "SC13",
      "finding": "SocialRelax selects active gathering spots with reachability/safety/propriety checks. Eat-surface tables require an adjacent free sittable (30 random cardinal-cell attempts), without ground fallback. Non-Eat spots search chairs within3.9 then valid ground. No companion requirement exists in this giver. Optional nurseable recreational drink is not required.",
